    clear: {
        "glass": (0.72, 0.86, 0.95, 0.3),
    },

    // `category` groups items in stockpile settings. Food has `nutrition`
    // (hunger restored per unit); `raw` food upsets colonists and may give
    // food poisoning (`poison`: chance per unit eaten). `medicine`: how much
    // it improves tending (1 = full medicine). `pods`: amounts arriving in
    // cargo pods. `weapon` and `apparel` items are picked up and used by
    // colonists; `held` is how a weapon looks in hand.
