    // Colonists land armed with this.
    start_weapon: Some("rifle"),
    // Raiders carry one of these (relative chances).
    raider_weapons: [("pistol", 2.0), ("club", 1.0), ("knife", 1.0)],
    // What mining one cell of rock or ore yields (soil yields nothing).
    rock_drops: ("stone", 6),
    ore_drops: ("iron_ore", 4),

    // Player-built structures, listed in the toolbar menu named by
    // `category`. `special` marks behaviour the game handles in code: `Floor`
    // (a slab others stand on, built in the air), `Stairs` (connect a cell to
    // the one above), `Bed` (sleep and recover), `Door` (swings open),
    // `Table` and `Seat` (colonists eat sitting at a table).
    // `beauty` counts towards the quality of the room it's in (or borders);
    // `daylight` lights the rooms it borders; `storage` holds more items per
    // cell. `along_walls`: modelled spanning x, turned to run along the walls
    // beside it (doors, windows). Parts with `link` only show when the
    // neighbour that way is the same structure or a wall. Removing a
    // structure drops `drops`, or half its cost if not given. `look: Block`
    // means it is drawn as a solid block with the terrain (walls); its parts
    // only matter otherwise.
